# ── Supabase (admin backend: collections, products, reviews, content, image uploads) ──
# Without these the site still renders using built-in defaults, but admin edits
# won't persist. Set BOTH here (local) and in Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables.
# Server-only — do NOT prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC (keeps the key out of the browser).
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-secret
